Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Slowy’s Counterattack
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 32
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s all my fault; I failed to protect Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn’t have known she had other tricks up her sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.39,0:00:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s not blame ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.11,0:00:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to figure out how to rescue Mr. Slowy and retrieve the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why overthink it? We can just head straight to the rift and get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are so many rifts inside that space…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where Mr. Slowy was taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you get lost too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.18,0:01:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just sitting here waiting isn’t going to work either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.22,0:01:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh right, didn’t we have a drone that located the mysterious man’s base earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But who knows how to operate this computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.66,0:01:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me do it; I’ve been Mr. Slowy’s assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.42,0:01:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I should know a thing or two about how to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.97,0:01:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the signal to that drone has been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.81,0:01:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy was right—they were prepared for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you see it before?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.87,0:01:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.23,0:02:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my Paper Beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn’t expect me to have this trick up my sleeve, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.30,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the one that’s been monitoring me all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But how is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Their eyes are connected to my screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.32,0:02:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,After you defeated it that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.11,0:02:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,you kept studying its remains,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.59,0:02:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and wanted to use those remains to track down my location.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But at the same time, I was using its vision to study you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,By observing your conversations and actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.71,0:02:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I analyzed your personalities, connections,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.99,0:02:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and specific abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.59,0:02:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In the process, I discovered that they were all acting on your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the biggest obstacle to retrieving the multicolored fragments…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.19,0:02:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,is you, Slowy—the one pulling the strings from behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.11,0:02:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That is exactly why I went out of my way to capture you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid of my plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.23,0:03:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve been secretly filming me for so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,so you must have captured footage of me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.39,0:03:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If that got out, everyone would laugh their heads off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.59,0:03:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you’re afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just admit you’ve lost, Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing you do can change
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.87,0:03:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,the outcome where I obtain the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Are you sure you can get the fragment inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can a mere box stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn’t think a little thing like this could stop me, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It actually has a protective measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.99,0:03:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn’t see this step coming, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.47,0:03:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.40,0:03:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn’t expect me to have a trick like this up my sleeve as well, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.39,0:03:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you set this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.07,0:04:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, are you sure you want to put this inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.99,0:04:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s dangerous; it could explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.99,0:04:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Just listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.39,0:04:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.51,0:04:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,we’d be researching this with instant noodles in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It is how things were, and now I’m ready to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.19,0:04:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think you have the ability to take the fragment from my turf?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll find out if I can or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.28,0:04:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a special sonic wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.01,0:04:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t understand your technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,By the same token, you don’t understand mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:05:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my turf; you can’t escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to this world? Why is it so desolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough luck. You were so close to getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.13,0:05:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting here was enough; now it’s my turn to strike back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are an amusing old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:05:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.20,0:06:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? Did you find something new?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.40,0:06:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve detected that all of Mr. Slowy’s drones have converged on a single location.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.45,0:06:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t see that coming, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.49,0:06:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did all these drones come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think my cane was just a cane?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.28,0:06:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s see if you can escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.29,0:07:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the fragment?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.01,0:07:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think my drone was only meant to fend you off?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re back. How did the two of you do with collecting the fragments?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.28,0:07:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I recovered all the fragments from the southern rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s exactly what I expected from you; I knew you’d get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The fragments from the east are all here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don’t understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.73,0:08:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue is already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.21,0:08:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we going to such lengths to find Blue’s fragments?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.41,0:08:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I said it before…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue isn’t reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.05,0:08:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet you all insist on trusting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.52,0:08:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should we waste time saving him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Having you collect these fragments
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,wasn’t just about saving him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.65,0:08:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It was mainly for the immense energy contained within them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.08,0:08:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That energy is meant to be used once I’ve repaired the device.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That the device is crucial for restoring our world, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, fine—here, take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If that’s all, I’m heading back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There are still two fragments left to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink, I’m counting on you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do that, but I have a condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.46,0:09:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a signal from Mr. Slowy that gathered the drones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.30,0:09:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we know the location, let’s go save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.35,0:09:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.66,0:09:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a drone flying back toward us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.62,0:09:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you said
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.62,0:09:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,everything we do is for the sake of our world…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So, anyone could be the captain, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.06,0:09:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, say, someone with superb skills and outstanding ability—me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We can discuss who becomes captain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.62,0:09:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The top priority is retrieving the fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue is no longer fit to be captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.26,0:09:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually lost to two nobodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he possibly save our world?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can bring those two fragments back,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you will become the new captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.46,0:09:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But be careful—there’s a group interfering with our operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.94,0:09:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Be especially wary of that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.94,0:10:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He can wield a strange kind of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.02,0:10:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then just wait for good news from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.10,0:10:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, they turn on each other, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you send me to get it? Do you think I’m not capable enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.23,0:10:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Retrieving the fragment is just one step in our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.82,0:10:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The next step…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.10,0:10:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,is that we must start repairing this Absorption Device.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re expecting some guests soon; I need you to host them properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.03,0:10:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I have to stay here and oversee the progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.42,0:10:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can leave it to me—rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.82,0:10:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,These fragments are…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.61,0:10:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:10:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.73,0:11:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,…we must collect the fragments as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We absolutely cannot let these dangerous things fall into the hands of bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.81,0:11:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, the consequences would be unimaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.10,0:11:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.22,0:11:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.42,0:11:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To bring the fragments back,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy sacrificed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.81,0:11:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The location is known, and the enemy has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.66,0:11:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re going to rescue Mr. Slowy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you all go, what about these fragments?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.65,0:11:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, we’re counting on you to keep a close watch on these fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But these fragments are so important…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.49,0:11:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What if they attack again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.32,0:11:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I stay behind and guard the fragments with Planie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.20,0:11:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.69,0:11:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, if anything happens, I can provide backup support.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.49,0:11:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.80,0:11:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we’re leaving the protection of Green Green Grassland to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:12:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, it’s time for you to step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t go around crying anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.65,0:12:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let’s get going.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
